Benefits of Chunking

| Benefit              | Explanation                                                            |
| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Faster retrieval     | Searches only small chunks instead of the whole document.              |
| Better accuracy      | Retrieves information that is directly related to the user's question. |
| Lower token usage    | Sends only relevant chunks to the LLM, reducing prompt size.           |
| Lower cost           | Fewer input tokens generally mean lower API costs.                     |
| Improved scalability | Makes it practical to work with very large document collections.       |


